WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:14.785
Vinnie and Mandy followed Varius.

2
00:00:15.846 --> 00:00:19.167
They were walking down a road of large, flat stones.

3
00:00:19.187 --> 00:00:21.768
"Where is the forum?"

4
00:00:22.508 --> 00:00:23.309
asked Mandy.

5
00:00:23.329 --> 00:00:28.651
"On Palatine Hill, the oldest part of Rome," said Varius.

6
00:00:28.671 --> 00:00:31.132
"What is the forum?"

7
00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:32.621
Vinnie asked.

8
00:00:32.641 --> 00:00:37.664
"Look around," laughed Varius.

9
00:00:37.684 --> 00:00:38.865
"We're here."

10
00:00:39.926 --> 00:00:43.348
They were in an area filled with people and stalls.

11
00:00:44.549 --> 00:00:46.610
Everything seemed to be for sale.

12
00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.732
"Would you like some figs?"

13
00:00:49.492 --> 00:00:50.613
asked one merchant.

14
00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:53.595
"Look!" said Varius.

15
00:00:54.756 --> 00:00:57.958
A toy seller held up a wooden horse with wings.

16
00:00:57.978 --> 00:01:00.720
"What's happening there?"

17
00:01:01.592 --> 00:01:03.012
Vinnie said, pointing.

18
00:01:04.313 --> 00:01:08.834
People were standing in a big circle watching two men fight.

19
00:01:10.114 --> 00:01:12.295
The men held swords and shields.

20
00:01:12.315 --> 00:01:14.476
"I can't look!"

21
00:01:15.076 --> 00:01:17.296
said Mandy, covering her eyes.

22
00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:20.157
Varius laughed.

23
00:01:21.878 --> 00:01:22.998
"They are gladiators!"

24
00:01:23.498 --> 00:01:24.038
he said.

25
00:01:24.058 --> 00:01:27.799
"Gladiators?" asked Vinnie.

26
00:01:27.819 --> 00:01:32.041
"Highly trained fighters," explained Varius.

27
00:01:32.061 --> 00:01:34.642
"They are just practicing now.

28
00:01:35.262 --> 00:01:37.003
But people pay to watch them fight."

29
00:01:37.023 --> 00:01:39.804
"Do they get hurt?"

30
00:01:40.584 --> 00:01:41.425
asked Mandy.

31
00:01:42.665 --> 00:01:49.568
Varius laughed louder and said, "Gladiators fight to the death."

32
00:01:50.729 --> 00:01:52.910
Mandy's face got very white.

33
00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:57.512
Vinnie and Mandy followed Varius through the forum.

34
00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:00.842
"Look at those buildings!"

35
00:02:01.542 --> 00:02:02.723
exclaimed Mandy.

36
00:02:04.024 --> 00:02:07.107
The forum was filled with temples and statues.

37
00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:11.971
"Septimus will be in the main office building," Varius said.

38
00:02:11.991 --> 00:02:16.075
"Most Roman officials work there," he added.

39
00:02:17.356 --> 00:02:18.977
They walked a little farther.

40
00:02:18.997 --> 00:02:22.360
"Here it is," said Varius.

41
00:02:23.721 --> 00:02:26.664
The children followed Varius into the building.

42
00:02:27.984 --> 00:02:30.366
Varius walked over to some men.

43
00:02:31.507 --> 00:02:34.229
One man smiled when he saw Varius.

44
00:02:34.249 --> 00:02:39.294
"Septimus, I am sorry to interrupt you," said Varius.

45
00:02:39.314 --> 00:02:42.736
"No problem!"

46
00:02:43.437 --> 00:02:44.578
laughed Septimus.

47
00:02:45.859 --> 00:02:48.401
Then he saw Varius' worried face.

48
00:02:49.342 --> 00:02:50.122
"What is the matter?"

49
00:02:51.824 --> 00:02:56.608
Varius introduced the children and told him what Mandy had overheard.

50
00:02:57.632 --> 00:03:00.753
"Brutus is so jealous," said Septimus.

51
00:03:01.753 --> 00:03:04.214
"We cannot allow him to carry out his plan."

52
00:03:05.614 --> 00:03:09.955
"We'll help," said Vinnie and Mandy at the same time.

53
00:03:11.076 --> 00:03:12.116
Septimus nodded.

54
00:03:12.136 --> 00:03:14.577
"I will find Aquila and warn him."

55
00:03:15.757 --> 00:03:17.517
Mandy's cheeks grew red.

56
00:03:17.537 --> 00:03:20.638
"But what about the horses?"

57
00:03:21.238 --> 00:03:21.939
she yelled.

58
00:03:21.959 --> 00:03:27.060
"Tell Aquila's stable boy to guard them carefully," he said.

59
00:03:28.032 --> 00:03:31.455
"And find Master Antonius," he said to Varius.

60
00:03:32.556 --> 00:03:34.177
"He will be supervising the race.

61
00:03:34.557 --> 00:03:35.578
Tell him this news.

62
00:03:35.838 --> 00:03:36.739
Go quickly!"

63
00:03:39.321 --> 00:03:42.324
Varius and the children headed to the stables.

64
00:03:43.885 --> 00:03:46.787
A boy carrying a bucket was hurrying by.

65
00:03:47.568 --> 00:03:48.709
Varius stopped him.

66
00:03:48.729 --> 00:03:51.551
"Where is Aquila's stable boy?"

67
00:03:52.132 --> 00:03:53.012
Varius asked.

68
00:03:53.032 --> 00:03:55.594
"Young Melus?"

69
00:03:56.355 --> 00:03:57.276
replied the boy.

70
00:03:58.292 --> 00:04:00.153
"His mother became ill suddenly.

71
00:04:01.093 --> 00:04:02.153
He had to rush home."

72
00:04:02.173 --> 00:04:04.194
"Oh no!"

73
00:04:04.874 --> 00:04:05.754
cried Mandy.

74
00:04:05.774 --> 00:04:09.175
"No one is watching the horses!"

75
00:04:09.195 --> 00:04:12.376
"Where does Melus live?"

76
00:04:13.096 --> 00:04:13.837
said Vinnie.

77
00:04:13.857 --> 00:04:16.117
"His father is a butcher.

78
00:04:17.017 --> 00:04:18.678
You know where to look."

79
00:04:18.718 --> 00:04:20.098
The boy hurried away.

80
00:04:20.118 --> 00:04:23.499
"Come!" said Varius sharply.

81
00:04:23.519 --> 00:04:25.400
"Time is running out!"
